WEBVTT

00:46:55.629 --> 00:47:00.088
I now have a practice
where I dance every day --

00:47:00.112 --> 00:47:01.561
and I'm not a dancer.

00:47:01.585 --> 00:47:03.541
I wouldn't want you to see me do it.

00:47:03.565 --> 00:47:05.076
(Laughter)

00:47:05.100 --> 00:47:07.315
But grief is a full-body experience.

00:47:07.339 --> 00:47:09.867
You know, as you know,
it takes over your entire body.

00:47:09.891 --> 00:47:11.406
It's not a disease of the mind.

00:47:11.430 --> 00:47:14.563
It's something that impacts you
at the physical level.

00:47:14.587 --> 00:47:17.280
And to be able to actually move your body

00:47:17.304 --> 00:47:20.095
and allow movement
to kind of let that energy --

00:47:20.119 --> 00:47:22.193
it's an energy that wants
to go through you.

00:47:22.217 --> 00:47:25.384
I feel like it has a tremendous
relationship to love.

00:47:25.408 --> 00:47:29.512
Because first of all it's, as they say,
it's the price you pay for love,

00:47:29.536 --> 00:47:34.039
but secondly, in the moments in my life
where I have been in love,